WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.419
Crowdin's CLI and Lingo.dev
translate in CI; repository syncs

2
00:00:06.419 --> 00:00:08.032
return a pull request.

3
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.994
General Translation translates
new copy before each build,

4
00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:13.293
with shared terms.

5
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.821
Its CLI runs before your build,

6
00:00:16.821 --> 00:00:19.897
and you wrap JSX in
&lt;T&gt; with no keys.

7
00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:25.707
The Locadex agent opens pull
requests that wrap new UI text

8
00:00:25.707 --> 00:00:26.786
nobody marked.

9
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:32.003
On Vercel, the build command
runs npx gt translate before next

10
00:00:32.003 --> 00:00:32.490
build.

11
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.275
Reviewers correct
wording in the Dashboard,

12
00:00:35.275 --> 00:00:39.372
and you can keep your existing
i18next or next-intl setup.

13
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.657
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
